{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">IS-LEAD-BYTE function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309892","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/IS-LEAD-BYTE-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/IS-LEAD-BYTE-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"IS-LEAD-BYTE-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">IS-LEAD-BYTE function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns TRUE if the first character of the\nstring is the lead-byte of a multi-byte character. Returns FALSE\nif it is not. </p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"IS-LEAD-BYTE-function__syntax_GC18S32695510\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d33961e101\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"IS-LEAD-BYTE-function__idGDM2JZ2672037\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>IS-LEAD-BYTE ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">string</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">string</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A character expression (a constant, field name, variable name,\nor any combination of these) whose value is a character.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"IS-LEAD-BYTE-function__example_GC18S42695516\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d33961e145\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">In\nthis example, IS-LEAD-BYTE returns TRUE because the first byte of\nthe first character is the lead-byte of a double-byte character.\nThe output is &quot;Lead: yes&quot;:</p>\n      <figure class=\"fig fignone\" id=\"IS-LEAD-BYTE-function__idGDE1SZ3601980\">\n        <br /><img class=\"image\" src=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LRI03.png?_LANG=enus\" /><br />\n      </figure>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"IS-LEAD-BYTE-function__see-also_GC18S52695520\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d33961e159\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"OVERLAY-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/OVERLAY-statement.html#OVERLAY-statement\">OVERLAY statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SUBSTRING-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SUBSTRING-statement.html#SUBSTRING-statement\">SUBSTRING statement</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"IS-DB-MULTI-TENANT-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/IS-DB-MULTI-TENANT-function.html\">IS-DB-MULTI-TENANT function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ISO-DATE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ISO-DATE-function.html\">ISO-DATE function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309892","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"IS-LEAD-BYTE function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/IS-LEAD-BYTE-function.html","type":"Manual"}